                "audio": "a54d89df02c2a0828a36bc2c87d0a3adbf8bfb44b282ae8bfc73be8e1c4dd0f4"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Compare the displayed person and big. The assigned writing subset includes person: after comparing the additional horizontal stroke in big, attempt person from memory in the separate writing part.\nFamiliar meanings available: person; people; big; large."
          }
        ]
